Package: file-library
Version: 1.0.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Maintainer: File Library <noreply@example.com>
Description: Browse and search videos, images and documents from several folders
 File Library indexes one or more source folders and shows the videos, images
 and documents inside them as a tree with file sizes in MB. The index is
 cached, so searching (case sensitive or insensitive) is instant and needs
 no rescan. The folder setup is stored with "Save config"; changes that
 are not saved are dropped when the app is restarted. The shown list can be
 exported as a .txt file, and a right-click on any file can copy its full path or open its folder
 in the file manager.
